# ── Runtime / generated ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
data/
.piper/

# ── Logs / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
.DS_Store

# ── Secrets (never commit) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*

# ── Internal-only design doc (mirror lives at docs/architecture.md) ─────
CLAUDE.md

# ── Working / WIP design notes (drafts, never publish) ──────────────────
docs/plans/
docs/runbooks/private/

